Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:05.93,CMCT中文字幕,,0,0,0000,,(普罗维登斯 罗得岛)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.50,0:02:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第13集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.46,0:00:03.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有多少？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How little?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.95,0:00:08.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,像你画的"一点"眼影那么少{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you put on a little eye shadow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.13,0:00:15.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而且你知道 这些东西也太不专业了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, you know, all this stuff is just like-It's just very unprofessional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.59,0:00:17.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别碰鱼饵{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch the troll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:21.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你约会的时候你妈妈常这么说话？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what your mom used to say to your dates?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.86,0:00:30.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,把鱼饵放下 否则我就在你两眼之间钉个钉子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put the trolls down or I'll put a staple right between your.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.94,0:00:32.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道这很困难{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I know it's hard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:35.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在你低落的时候很难抬头看{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hard to look up when you're down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:38.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,很难向上看到光明{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hard to look up and see the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.74,0:00:41.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但我要告诉你…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm here to tell you, folks...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.58,0:00:44.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,上帝与你同在{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Lord is with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.51,0:00:56.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不会痛苦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to suffer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.14,0:00:58.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也不会迷惑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to be lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:01.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,上帝正在对你说话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lord is talking to you right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.31,0:01:05.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他在说"你是我的子民 你有你的使命"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's saying, "You are my child and you have a purpose."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.39,0:01:08.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你觉得上帝抛弃了你？让我告诉你吧 不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think God forgot about you? I tell you, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:10.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们只需侧耳倾听{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you gotta do is listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.19,0:01:12.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,难道你们听不到天使的歌唱？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you just hear those angels singing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.82,0:01:16.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是不是很动听啊？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it beautiful?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.65,0:01:18.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是时候了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.66,0:01:21.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是时候接受他传达的信息了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to receive the message he's sending.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:24.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是时候倾听上帝的声音了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to listen to the word of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.96,0:01:29.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你听到天堂之声了吗？你说你没有听到吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you hear the glory? I said, can't you just hear it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.83,0:01:32.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你没听到上帝的声音吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say, can't you just hear the glory?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.06,0:01:51.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.80,0:02:16.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,早上好 你不是常来的那个人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning. You're not the usual guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:21.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是 呃… 我是替班的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, uh, just filling in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:24.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,今天你感觉如何 格洛里亚？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how you feeling today, Gloria?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.22,0:02:26.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,从没感觉这么好过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never felt better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.98,0:02:29.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,最近没有感觉不安？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So no disturbances lately?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:32.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是问我有没有精神错乱？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean, am I stark raving cuckoo for Cocoa Puffs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.23,0:02:35.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我没那么说 没关系{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't say that. - It's all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.90,0:02:37.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道大家怎么想的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what people must think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.78,0:02:42.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你怎么想？我想我看到的是真的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you think? - I think what I saw was real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:58.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想知道你看到了什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to know what you saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.63,0:03:03.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,和新闻上说的一样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was all over the news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.72,0:03:05.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我刺穿了一个人的心脏{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stabbed a man in the heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:07.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为什么这么做？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.39,0:03:09.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,因为那是上帝的意志{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it was God's will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.85,0:03:12.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,上帝和你说话了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did God talk to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.73,0:03:16.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我觉得上帝太忙了 不会有时间"家访"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get the sense God's a little busy for house calls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:19.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 他… 他派了别人来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he... He sent someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.57,0:03:20.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别人？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.95,0:03:22.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一位天使{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.87,0:03:29.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,伴随着那种美丽的白光出现在我面前{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It came to me in this beautiful white light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.25,0:03:31.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我的心中充满了那种…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it filled me with this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:34.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,感觉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}feeling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.71,0:03:37.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那… 那很难描述{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hard to describe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.67,0:03:38.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后天使…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this angel...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.88,0:03:40.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,传达了上帝的旨意{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spoke God's word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.26,0:03:44.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那旨意是… 让你去杀人？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the word was to kill someone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.14,0:03:47.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来很怪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it sounds strange.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.81,0:03:50.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但我所作的事情非常重要{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what I did was very important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:52.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我帮助他惩罚了一个罪人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I helped him smite an evil man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是被选中…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was chosen...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:57.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,去救赎的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for redemption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.36,0:04:00.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那个被你杀的男人… 是天使给的名字吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man you stabbed, did the angel give you his name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:04.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有 他只告诉我等待"信号"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. He just told me to wait for the sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.86,0:04:09.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就在第二天 我在那人的门口旁看到了"信号"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the very next day I saw it, right beside the man's doorway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:11.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我就明白了 为什么杀他？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And I knew. - Why him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.04,0:04:14.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我只知道那个天使告诉我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just know what the angel told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.50,0:04:18.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那个男人已经罪恶到骨子里了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That this man was guilty to his deepest foundations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.92,0:04:21.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这对我来说就足够了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that was good enough for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.86,0:04:43.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.24,0:04:52.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.66,0:04:56.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嗨 老弟 你真该试试{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Man, you gotta try this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:58.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,"魔法手指"里真的有魔法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There really is magic in the magic fingers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.42,0:05:02.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 你怎么这么喜欢这个 我都有点不自在了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, you're enjoying that way too much. It's kind of making me uncomfortable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.76,0:05:03.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那你让我干嘛？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What am I supposed to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.97,0:05:05.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是你把我关在这儿的 都快无聊死了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got me on lockdown. I'm bored out of my skull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:10.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 上了11点新闻的银行劫犯是你 又不是我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you were the bank robber on the 11:00 news, not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.51,0:05:12.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,让你走进一个政府机构太冒险了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't risk you just walking into a government facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:21.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 见鬼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.90,0:05:23.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那可是我最后一个硬币了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was my last quarter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.69,0:05:24.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.07,0:05:27.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你有硬币么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got any quarters?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:28.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.78,0:05:33.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 那么 你混进去找到了那个疯子妓女？- 对{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So did you get in to see that crazy hooker? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:36.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,格洛里亚·瑟特尼克 我说不好她是不是真的疯了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gloria Sytnik. And I'm not so sure she's crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.08,0:05:39.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但她真的相信… 她和天使有约？"Touched by an Angel" CBS电视剧《天使有约》{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she seriously believes that she was touched by an angel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.25,0:05:44.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对 炫目的白光 内心的狂喜 还有使命{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Blinding light, feelings of spiritual ecstasy, the works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:49.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说 她被关在与世隔绝的病房里 心灵却非常平静{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, she's living in a locked ward and she's totally at peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.51,0:05:51.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 是啊 你说得没错听起来完全正常{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, you're right. Sounds completely sane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:54.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她捅死的那家伙呢？呃 卡尔·格利{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about the dude she stabbed? - Uh, Carl Gulley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.77,0:05:56.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她说她杀了他是因为他是恶魔 - 是吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Said she killed him because he was evil. - Was he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.06,0:05:59.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 不知道 我没发现他有什么污点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I couldn't find any dirt on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.65,0:06:03.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有犯罪记录 在大学图书馆工作 朋友众多{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't have a criminal record, he worked at the campus library, had lots of friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.78,0:06:06.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还是个虔诚的信徒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He was a churchgoer. - Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.32,0:06:08.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么格洛里亚就是那种标准的疯子？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So then Gloria's just your standard-issue wacko.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.45,0:06:12.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说 她又不是第一个这种{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, she wouldn't be the first nut job in history...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.53,0:06:14.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,借信仰之名杀人的神经病 明白我的意思吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to kill in the name of religion, know what I mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.79,0:06:17.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,的确不是 但她是镇上第二个 听从天使的指示杀人的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, but she's the second in town to murder because an angel told them to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.71,0:06:21.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有点怪 你不觉得么？是怪 也许是超自然现象{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A little bit odd, don't you think? - Odd, yes. Supernatural, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:23.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是说到天使 那不可能{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But angels? I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.38,0:06:26.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为什么？因为那种东西根本不存在 萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why not? - Because there's no such thing, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.34,0:06:31.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 关于天使的传说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, there's 10 times as much lore about angels...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:33.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是我们猎杀的那些东西的10倍多啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as there is about anything we've hunted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.06,0:06:36.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,独角兽的传说也有好多呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, there's a ton of lore on unicorns too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.18,0:06:40.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,据说他们在银色月光上奔跑 从屁股里往外喷彩虹{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear that they ride on silver moonbeams and they shoot rainbows out of their ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:43.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等等 独角兽不存在吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, there's no such thing as unicorns?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:47.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你可真可爱 我只是说 老弟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's cute. I'm just saying, man, there's some legends you just-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.82,0:06:50.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有些传说你得归到"狗屁"那类里去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You file under bull crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.61,0:06:54.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,天使就在你的"狗屁"传说名单上？- 没错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you got angels on the bull-crap list. - Yup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.28,0:06:55.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 为什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.70,0:06:59.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 因为我从没看见过 - 那又怎么样？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Because I've never seen one. - So what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.29,0:07:01.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就是说我只相信我看到的东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I believe in what I can see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.79,0:07:05.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 咱们俩见过的那些东西 大部分人连做梦都没见过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, you and I have seen things most people couldn't even dream about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.88,0:07:08.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,说的对 是我们亲眼所见的 那就是确凿的证据{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly. With our own eyes. That's hard proof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:13.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吗？但我从没见过任何类似天使的东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? But in all this time, I have never seen anything that looks like an angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.76,0:07:16.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,要是有 你不觉得我们早该碰到了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they existed, we would've crossed paths with them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.51,0:07:18.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,或者至少听说有人碰见过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or know someone that crossed paths with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.64,0:07:21.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 这肯定是魔鬼或恶灵干的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. This is a demon or a spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:24.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,找了几个又疯又傻的家伙{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They find people a few fries short of a Happy Meal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.19,0:07:26.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,骗他们随便找个人杀了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they trick them into killing these randoms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.07,0:07:28.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.86,0:07:35.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,咱们能不能… 我快闲得发疯了 去格洛里亚的公寓看看 行不？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we just? I'm going stir-crazy. Hey, let's go by Gloria's apartment, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.95,0:07:38.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我刚从那儿回来 什么也没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just there. Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.37,0:07:39.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有硫磺 EMF也没有反应{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sulfur, no EMF.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.58,0:07:42.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没看见毛茸茸的白羽毛？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't see any fluffy, white wing feathers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:47.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,可是格洛里亚说过天使在卡尔·格利的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Gloria did say the angel gave her a sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.42,0:07:49.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,门口留下某种"信号"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right beside Carl Gulley's doorway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.96,0:07:52.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许他家里有什么东西 值得去看看{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could be something at his house. It's worth checking out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:20.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hey, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:23.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想我找到了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think I found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:28.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,上天的信号{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a sign from up above.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.59,0:08:39.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我觉得我学到了宝贵的一课{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I think I learned a valuable lesson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.39,0:08:41.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,新年过后得记着把圣诞装饰都摘下来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take down your Christmas decorations after New Year's...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.14,0:08:44.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不然就会被上帝派来的妓女切成碎片{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or you might get filleted by a hooker from God. Ha.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.77,0:08:48.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我心里暗笑呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm laughing on the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:15.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,格洛里亚说那个男人已经罪恶到骨子里了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, Gloria said the guy was "guilty to his deepest foundations."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.18,0:09:18.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你觉得她是指字面意义上的"地下室"？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think she literally meant the foundation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.18,0:10:04.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,找到什么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.You got something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.02,0:10:09.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:15.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,指甲{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a fingernail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:39.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,真是个虔诚善良的图书馆员啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So much for the innocent, churchgoing librarian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.97,0:10:41.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不管告诉格洛里亚的是什么东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, whatever spoke to Gloria about this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.05,0:10:45.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,它都说中了 这个我敢保证{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}knew what it was talking about, I'll give you that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:35.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:38.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嗨 我叫扎克{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, my name is Zach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.21,0:12:40.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有什么事吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:13:01.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们有一个助教的摩托车和面包车{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a minor T.A. involving a, uh, motorcycle and a van.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.61,0:13:06.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在第二十八棵松树的角落里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is at the corner of, uh, 28th and Pine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:08.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,第二十八颗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}28th and Pine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.21,0:13:18.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你换硬币了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you bring quarters?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.05,0:13:26.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,老兄 我可不会助长你这种病态的爱好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, I'm not enabling your sick habit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.18,0:13:28.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你就跟实验室的小白鼠一样 把食物忘到一边{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're one of those lab rats that pushes the pleasure button...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.05,0:13:31.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只知道不停的享乐直到饿死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}instead of the food button until it dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.39,0:13:33.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你说什么呢？我吃饭的 还找到了新消息{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about? I eat. And I got news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:35.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我也是 - 好吧 你先说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Me too. - All right. You go first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:39.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,今年大学里一共有三个学生失踪 所有人最后出现的地点都是图书馆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three students disappeared off the campus this year. All were last seen at the library.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.65,0:13:41.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 卡尔·格利工作的那个图书馆 - 对{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where Carl Gulley worked. - Yup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:43.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 变态的混蛋 - 那么格洛里亚说的那个天使{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sick bastard. - So Gloria's angel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.94,0:13:46.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 天使？- 好吧 不管是什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Angel? - Okay, whatever this thing is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:49.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 不管是什么它又动手了 - 什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whatever it is, it struck again. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.53,0:13:52.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我偷听了警察的无线电 发现了这个家伙 扎克·施密特{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was listening to the police radio. There was this guy, uh, Zach Smitt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.16,0:13:56.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他喝醉了 昨晚走到一个陌生人家门口{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some local drunk. He went up to a stranger's front door last night...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.25,0:13:59.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一刀刺透他的心脏 - 他后来去警察局自首了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...stabbed him in the heart. - He went to the police and confessed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:01.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没错 罗玛·唐尼让他做的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yup. Roma Downey made him do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.13,0:14:03.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在 我 嗯…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.42,0:14:07.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有受害者的住址{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}got the victim's address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.67,0:14:42.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,找到什么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.09,0:14:46.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,弗兰克喜欢收藏购物目录 我只找到这些 你呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Frank liked his catalog-shopping. That's about all I got. You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.09,0:14:48.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not much here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.84,0:14:53.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,除了他计算机有个加密的档案 等会儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except he's got this one locked file on his computer that... Hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.31,0:15:03.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在没了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.19,0:15:06.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,老天啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:09.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 怎么？- 他发了好多邮件{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Uh, he has all these e-mails. Dozens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.49,0:15:12.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,给一个叫詹尼弗的女士{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To this lady named Jennifer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.20,0:15:19.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这位女士才13岁{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This lady who's 13 years old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:21.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 我不想听下去了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, I don't wanna hear this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:24.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看起来他们是在聊天室认识的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like they met in a chat room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.04,0:15:27.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这些邮件都涉及到私事 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These e-mails are pretty personal, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.51,0:15:29.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,瞧这个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.97,0:15:32.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 他们订了见面的时间和地点 - 太棒了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Setting up a time and place to meet. - Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:35.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们本该今天见面{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were supposed to meet today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:44.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我猜要是捅人 这个时间挑的不错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess if you're gonna stab someone, good timing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.90,0:15:46.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道 这太奇怪了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, man, this is weird, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.02,0:15:49.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说 当然有些鬼魂是为了报仇杀人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, some spirits are out for vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.45,0:15:51.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但这一个简直是在做好事 就像…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this one's almost like a do-gooder. Like a{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.82,0:15:53.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,复仇天使？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Avenging angel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.91,0:15:56.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还有别的解释吗 迪恩？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How else do you explain it, Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.91,0:16:00.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,三个受害者之间没有任何关联 心脏都被捅了一刀{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three guys, not connected to each other, all stabbed through the heart?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.41,0:16:02.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,其中至少两个都是罪该万死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least two were world-class pervs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.87,0:16:05.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 而且我敢说 如果你深入调查剩下的那个 - 嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I bet if you dug deep on the other guy. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.54,0:16:08.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 你说过卡尔·格利是个信徒 对不对？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Carl Gulley was a churchgoer, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:10.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 他去的哪个教堂？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - What was the name of his church?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.59,0:16:16.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,"天使之后"？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our Lady of the Angels?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.89,0:16:20.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,果然是这个名字 看起来弗兰克也去同一个教堂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course that'd be the name. Looks like Frank went to the same church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.28,0:16:32.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么 你们愿意加入这个教区？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're interested in joining the parish?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.44,0:16:35.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们俩每周日不去教堂就浑身难受{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just don't feel right unless we hit church every Sunday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.20,0:16:36.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们以前住在哪儿？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where'd you say you lived? Uh-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:38.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,得克萨斯的普雷蒙{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Premont, Texas. Yup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.53,0:16:40.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,真的？那可是个不错的小镇{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? That's a nice town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.41,0:16:43.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在圣特里沙教区 你们肯定认识那里的神父了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}St. Theresa's Parish. You must know the priest there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.66,0:16:46.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,当然了 是奥马利神父{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, yeah. No, it's, uh, Father O'Malley.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:48.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我认识的是一位肖尼西神父{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm, I know a Father Shaughnessy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.92,0:16:50.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,肖尼西神父 没错 我刚才说的是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shaughnessy. Exactly. What did I say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.88,0:16:52.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们很高兴能加入 神父{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just happy to be here now, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.05,0:16:56.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们也很希望你们加入 我们需要一些年轻人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're happy to have you. We could use some young blood around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:59.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想问一下 无意冒犯 但这周围的环境…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm. Listen, I gotta ask, and no offense, but the neighborhood-?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.64,0:17:01.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这里的治安有些不好 我不否认{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gone to seed a little, there's no denying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.06,0:17:04.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但这才是教堂的重要意义所在{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why what the church does here is important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.77,0:17:08.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就像我常说的 你可以期待奇迹 但同时也要努力工作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can expect a miracle, but in the meantime, you work your butt off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.77,0:17:10.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对 我们听说了那些谋杀{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We heard about the murders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:13.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 受害者都是我的教民 我和他们认识很久了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. The victims were parishioners of mine. I'd known them for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.82,0:17:16.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那些犯人都说是天使让他们做的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the killers said that an angel made them do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.03,0:17:18.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 都是些被误导的灵魂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. Misguided souls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.78,0:17:22.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,居然认为上帝的信使会煽动他们杀人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To think that God's messenger would appear and incite people to murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.62,0:17:25.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 真是悲惨 - 这么说 你不相信天使？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's tragic. - So you don't believe in those angel yarns?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.96,0:17:29.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 不是的 我当然相信 这是我工作的一部分{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, I absolutely believe. Kind of goes with the job description.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:31.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,神父 那是米迦勒 对吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, that's Michael, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.84,0:17:37.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 天使长米迦勒 手持火焰之剑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, the Archangel Michael with the flaming sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.14,0:17:40.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他是对抗魔鬼的战士{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fighter of demons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:43.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是击败邪恶的光明力量{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And a holy force against evil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.56,0:17:47.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看来不是印在明信片上的 那种大家心目中的天使形象{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So they're not really the Hallmark-card version that everybody thinks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.31,0:17:49.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们很勇猛 对不对？高度警惕的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're fierce, right? Vigilant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.56,0:17:52.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我比较喜欢他们可爱的形象 而不是这么愤怒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I like to think of them as more loving than wrathful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.94,0:17:57.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但… 的确 很多关于圣经的画像 都把天使表现为神的战士{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, yes, a lot of Scripture paints angels as God's warriors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.82,0:18:03.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,"有主的使者站在他们旁边" "主的荣光四面照着他们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An angel of the Lord appeared to them, glory of the Lord shone down upon them...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.95,0:18:06.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,牧羊人甚为恐慌"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they were terrified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.67,0:18:12.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,路加福音 第二章 第九节{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luke 2:9.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.26,0:18:22.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 谢谢和你的谈话 神父 - 我很荣幸{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for speaking with us. It's my pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.35,0:18:25.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 希望能再见到你们 - 神父 这是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hope to see you again. - Hey, Father. What's all that for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.56,0:18:29.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 那是给格雷戈瑞神父的 他曾经是这里的神父{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's for Father Gregory. He was a priest here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.69,0:18:30.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,曾经？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.06,0:18:32.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他就是在这台阶上去世的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Passed away right on these steps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.11,0:18:36.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 被葬在教堂的地墓 - 这是什么时候发生的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He's interred in the church crypt. - When did this happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:39.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,两个月前 有人为了抢车钥匙枪杀了他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two months ago. He was shot for his car keys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.95,0:18:42.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 很抱歉 - 我也是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm sorry. - Yeah, me too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.70,0:18:44.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他是个好朋友{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a good friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.66,0:18:47.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我连为他做临终圣礼的时间都没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't even have time to administer his last rites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:50.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但就像我说的 这里的环境不太好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But like I said, it's a tough neighborhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:54.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,自从他死后 我就全心全意地祈祷{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever since he died, I've been praying my heart out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.88,0:18:56.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 祈祷什么？- 解脱…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For what? - For deliverance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.09,0:19:00.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,从那些暴力和血腥里解脱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the violence and the bloodshed around here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.84,0:19:02.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们真的需要一点神的干预了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could use a little divine intervention, I suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.10,0:19:08.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好 神父 谢谢你 我们会再来的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Padre, thanks. We'll see you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.74,0:19:23.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 这下就说得通了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all starting to make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.82,0:19:25.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,虔诚的教士死于暴力{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Devoted priest dies a violent death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.20,0:19:28.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这可是变成恶灵复仇的上好材料{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's vengeful-spirit material right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:30.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他知道那些人的罪 因为他们都在这个教堂忏悔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knew the other stiffs, they went to church here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.79,0:19:32.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我敢打赌 因为是他们的神父{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm willing to bet, because he was their priest...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.92,0:19:34.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他知道他们隐藏的秘密{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he knew things about them nobody else knew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.96,0:19:36.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then again...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.05,0:19:40.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,两个月前雷诺神父 开始祈求上帝的帮助 对吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father Reynolds started praying for God's help two months ago, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.13,0:19:44.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 也正好是那些凶杀开始的时间 - 哦 好了 你怎么回事？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- About the time all this started happening. - Come on. What's your deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.64,0:19:46.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你什么意思？- 我承认我是有点无神论{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you mean? - I'll admit, I'm a bit of a skeptic...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.06,0:19:49.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但你什么时候变成700俱乐部的信徒了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but since when are you all Mr. 700 Club?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.31,0:19:53.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,说真的 从一开始 你就想相信那些天使的胡话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seriously, from the get-go, you've been willing to buy this angel crap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.31,0:19:56.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后呢？难道你要开始每天祈祷？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, what's next, you gonna start praying every day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.94,0:19:59.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:03.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我每天都祈祷{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - I do pray every day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.11,0:20:05.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,已经很长时间了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:11.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,又了解你一点了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The things you learn about a guy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.75,0:20:17.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 我们去看看格雷戈瑞神父的墓{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's check out Father Gregory's grave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.01,0:21:08.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 快点 别磨蹭了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, come on. Get the lead out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.89,0:21:11.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.23,0:21:14.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam. Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.52,0:21:18.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 没事吧？- 没事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:21.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.82,0:21:25.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我没事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.36,0:21:27.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:36.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你看到它了 对吧？是不是？- 对{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You saw it, didn't you? Didn't you? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.71,0:21:40.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对 迪恩 我看到了天使{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Dean, I saw an angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:45.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.05,0:21:49.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不想喝酒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want a drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.39,0:21:56.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你为什么觉得看到了… 呃… 天使？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what makes you think you saw a, uh, angel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.94,0:21:58.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,因为…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.56,0:22:02.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,它出现在我面前 我…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appeared before me and just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.90,0:22:07.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我全身都充满了一种感觉 你知道 就像…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This feeling washed over me, you know, like peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.32,0:22:08.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,像那种平静 感恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like grace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.57,0:22:10.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 幸福男孩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, ecstasy boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.95,0:22:13.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许该给你找根 亮晶晶的手杖和休斯博士的漂亮帽子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we'll get you some glow sticks and a nice Dr. Seuss hat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.62,0:22:15.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 我没开玩笑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, I'm serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.41,0:22:17.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,它和我说话 知道我是谁{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It spoke to me. It knew who I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.04,0:22:20.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那只是个鬼魂 萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a spirit, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.33,0:22:23.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,又不是第一个能读心的鬼魂了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? And it's not the first one to be able to read people's minds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.92,0:22:26.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 让我猜猜{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let me guess...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.34,0:22:28.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你被选中去惩罚某个罪人？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you were personally chosen to smite some sinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.05,0:22:31.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只需等着神圣的小蝙蝠给你个信号 是吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just gotta wait for some divine Bat Signal, is that it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.76,0:22:33.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对 没错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.56,0:22:35.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,太好了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.77,0:22:37.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我猜你没问那个坏家伙 到底犯了什么坏事吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't suppose you asked what this bad guy did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.06,0:22:39.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,实际上我问了 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, I did, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.15,0:22:41.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,天使也告诉我了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the angel told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.06,0:22:43.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他现在{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hasn't done anything...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.73,0:22:45.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还没做什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.23,0:22:46.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但他会的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.61,0:22:49.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 这简直 我可不信{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this is-I don't believe this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.70,0:22:51.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 天使从来没错过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, the angel hasn't been wrong yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.12,0:22:54.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有人要做可怕的事 而我能制止他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone's gonna do something awful and I can stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.08,0:22:56.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还有人说你也会变坏呢 萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to be bad too, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.62,0:22:58.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许我应该现在就制止你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I should just stop you right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.96,0:23:02.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,知道吗 迪恩？我就是不明白 你为什么都不肯考虑一下这种可能性？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, I don't understand. Why can't you even consider the possibility?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.04,0:23:05.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 什么可能性 你是说那东西是天使？- 对{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What, that this is an angel? - Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.46,0:23:08.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们也许在猎杀一个天使 我们应该停手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we're hunting an angel here and we should stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.51,0:23:10.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许这是上帝的意志{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe this is God's will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.01,0:23:15.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 好了 我明白你的意思了 你有信仰了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. All right. You know what? I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.31,0:23:19.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这 嘿 这很好 肯定能让你的日子好过点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've got faith. Hey, good for you. I'm sure it makes things easier.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.89,0:23:23.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,告诉你 还有一个像你一样有信仰的 就是妈妈{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you who else had faith like that: Mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.23,0:23:29.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她给我盖被子的时候告诉我 天使会保护我们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She used to tell me when she tucked me in that angels were watching over us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.82,0:23:32.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,实际上这是她对我说的最后一句话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, that was the last thing she said to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.32,0:23:35.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你从没告诉过我 - 有什么可说的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You never told me that. - What's to tell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.37,0:23:37.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她错了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.70,0:23:39.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那时候没有人保护她{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was nothing protecting her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.12,0:23:42.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这世上没有神灵 没有上帝{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no higher power, there's no God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.83,0:23:46.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只有混乱 暴力和无序{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, there's just chaos and violence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.00,0:23:51.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还有不知从哪儿来的无法预知的魔鬼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Random, unpredictable evil that comes out of nowhere...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.38,0:23:53.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,把你撕成碎片{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and rips you to shreds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.18,0:23:56.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你想要我相信天使？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you want me to believe in this stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.10,0:23:59.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那我需要确凿的证据 你有吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna need to see some hard proof. You got any?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.19,0:24:03.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我可有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.19,0:24:06.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,能够证明我们对付的是个恶灵的证据{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proof that we're dealing with a spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.03,0:24:17.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 这好像是… - 苦艾{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It looks like... - It's wormwood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.58,0:24:21.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在死人附近生长的草 特别是没有安息的死者{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plant associated with the dead. Specifically, the ones that are not at rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.37,0:24:26.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别处可没看到这种草 除了被谋杀的神父的墓碑上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see it growing anywhere else, except over the murdered priest's marker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.67,0:24:29.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就是他 萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's him, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.46,0:24:32.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.01,0:24:35.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 也许？- 迪恩 我不知道该怎么办了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe? - Dean, I don't know what to think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.64,0:24:38.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.85,0:24:41.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,想要更多证据？那我就给你更多证据{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want some more proof? I'll give you more proof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.81,0:24:43.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怎么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.60,0:24:45.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,召唤格雷戈瑞的鬼魂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll summon Gregory's spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.48,0:24:47.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.56,0:24:50.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在这儿？教堂里？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here? In the church?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.61,0:24:52.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.99,0:24:57.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没错 我们只要准备些工具 爸爸的笔记里有降灵术{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we just need a few odds and ends and that seance ritual in Dad's journal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.20,0:25:00.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,降灵术？好啊 要是有狂欢就更好了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, seance, great. Hope Whoopi's available.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.24,0:25:02.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有趣 真有趣 说真的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's funny, actually. Seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.00,0:25:07.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果格雷戈瑞神父的鬼魂在附近 就会被降灵术召唤出来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Father Gregory's spirit is around, the seance will bring him right to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.54,0:25:10.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果是他干的 我们就让他安息{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it's him, then we'll put him to rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.50,0:25:12.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但如果真是天使 它就不会出现{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if it's an angel, it won't show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.09,0:25:16.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 什么也不会发生 - 没错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Nothing will happen. - Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.43,0:25:19.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这就是干咱们这行的好处之一 萨姆 不用为信仰争论{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's one of the perks of the job. We don't have to operate on faith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.93,0:25:21.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们有确认的办法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can know for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.39,0:25:23.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,难道你不想知道吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't you wanna know for sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.15,0:25:34.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,老兄… 好吧 我承认我们以前也用过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, all right, I'll admit, we've gone pretty ghetto...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.74,0:25:37.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不少咒语 可这种还是第一次{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with spell work before, but this takes the cake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.45,0:25:40.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说 用海绵宝宝的垫子代替祭坛布？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, a SpongeBob placemat instead of an altar cloth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.41,0:25:43.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,海绵宝宝那面往下不就行了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll just put it SpongeBob side down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.33,0:25:49.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 就是那个 - 什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dean, that's it. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.92,0:25:51.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那就是"信号"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.84,0:25:54.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 哪儿？- 就在那家伙身后{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where? - Right there. Right behind that guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.51,0:25:57.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就是他 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.59,0:25:59.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们得阻止他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.48,0:26:12.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 等会儿 - 你干吗？放开我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait a minute. - What are you doing? Let me go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.90,0:26:15.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不会被一个鬼魂唆使去杀人吧？你疯了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna kill somebody because a ghost told you. Are you insane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.90,0:26:18.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不是要杀他 只是想阻止他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not insane. I'm not gonna kill him, I'm gonna stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.36,0:26:21.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怎么阻止 嗯？你要怎么做？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Define "stop, " huh? I mean, what are you gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.53,0:26:25.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 求你了 他会伤害某人 你知道的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, please. He's gonna hurt someone, you know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.75,0:26:29.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 来吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.84,0:26:38.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.01,0:26:40.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,打开车门{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlock my door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.84,0:26:44.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不会让你杀人 萨姆 我跟着那家伙 你去降灵{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not killing anyone, Sam. I got this guy, you go do the seance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.72,0:26:46.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.73,0:28:19.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.69,0:28:22.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.41,0:28:30.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,神父 我可以解释的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, please. I can explain. Uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.79,0:28:33.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不过也许我没法解释 呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, maybe I can't. Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.00,0:28:38.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是… 一种降灵术{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is, uh, a seance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.05,0:28:42.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,降灵术？年轻人 这里可是神之殿堂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A seance? Young man, you are in a house of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.47,0:28:45.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,其实这个降灵术 是来源于早期基督教的仪式的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's based on early Christian rites, if that helps any.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.14,0:28:47.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,够了 你跟我来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough. You're coming with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.80,0:28:51.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,神父 求你了 再等一会儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, please, you-Just wait a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.60,0:28:54.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.65,0:28:59.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.57,0:29:00.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,天使吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that an angel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.32,0:29:03.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 不是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.74,0:29:06.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只是格雷戈瑞神父的鬼魂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just Father Gregory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.50,0:29:15.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,托马斯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.12,0:29:18.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是来回应你的祈祷的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come in answer to your prayers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.52,0:29:40.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.82,0:29:43.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我已经给你指出了路 你应该快点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I sent you on your path. You should hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.82,0:29:47.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,神父 很抱歉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.78,0:29:50.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但你不是天使{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're not an angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.99,0:29:52.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我当然是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.16,0:29:54.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.12,0:29:57.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是个人 是鬼魂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a man. You're a spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.75,0:30:01.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你应该安息{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you need to rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.75,0:30:03.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我曾经是人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was a man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.01,0:30:05.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但现在是天使{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now I'm an angel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.01,0:30:10.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,当时我在教堂的台阶上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was on the steps of the church.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.76,0:30:13.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,感到子弹穿透了我的身体{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I felt that bullet pierce right through me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.31,0:30:16.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但我并没感觉到痛苦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there was no pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.98,0:30:19.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后突然我能看到…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then suddenly, I could see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.48,0:30:22.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一切了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.78,0:30:29.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,雷诺神父 我看到了你… 在这里祈祷 哭泣{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father Reynolds, I saw you praying and crying here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.41,0:30:32.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是来帮助你的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came to help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.78,0:30:34.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怎么帮助我？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.15,0:31:03.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,妈的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.77,0:31:06.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那些谋杀…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those murders...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.86,0:31:09.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,都是因为你？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was because of you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.20,0:31:10.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我听到了上帝的声音{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I received the word of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.66,0:31:14.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他让我惩罚那些罪人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He spoke to me, told me to smite the wicked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.08,0:31:18.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我在实现他的意愿 - 你让那些无辜的人去杀人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm carrying out his will. - You're driving innocent people to kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.33,0:31:21.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那些无辜的人是在救赎{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those innocent people are being offered redemption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.84,0:31:26.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有些人需要救赎{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people need redemption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.96,0:31:28.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对吧 萨姆？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't they, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.97,0:31:31.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这怎么能叫救赎？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you call this redemption?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.51,0:31:36.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你现在还无法理解{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't understand it now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.68,0:31:39.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但人类的规矩和上帝的规则是不同的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The rules of man and the rules of God are two very different things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.06,0:31:41.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那些人…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those people...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.60,0:31:43.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们被关起来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they're locked up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.06,0:31:45.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 他们很幸福{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, they're happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.48,0:31:48.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们得到了平静 打败了内心的魔鬼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've found peace, beaten their demons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.03,0:31:51.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我给了他们通向天堂的钥匙 - 不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And I've given them the keys to heaven. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.91,0:31:54.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 这是复仇 这是错的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. This is vengeance, it's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.16,0:31:57.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,托马斯 这违背了你所相信的一切{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thomas, this goes against everything you believed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.12,0:31:59.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你被迷惑 被误导了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're lost, misguided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.58,0:32:03.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,神父… 不 我没有被误导{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, no, I'm not misguided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.50,0:32:05.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不是天使 托马斯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not an angel, Thomas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.79,0:32:07.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,人不会变成天使{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Men cannot be angels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.92,0:32:12.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.51,0:32:16.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是我 我不明白{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.56,0:32:24.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你祈祷着我的到来 - 我祈祷上帝的帮助 而不是这个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You prayed for me to come. - I prayed for God's help. Not this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.19,0:32:27.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你所作的事情不是上帝的意愿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What you're doing is not God's will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.69,0:32:30.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,"勿杀人"{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thou shalt not kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.69,0:32:32.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这才是上帝的教导{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the word of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.66,0:32:42.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为什么停车？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come we stopped?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.00,0:32:52.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,呃 我们不是要去看电影吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, weren't we gonna go to the movies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.68,0:32:57.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们应该快点 要迟到了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, we should go or we're gonna be late Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.22,0:33:01.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对不起 我只是 从来没有这么做过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, I'm sorry, I'm sorry. It's just I've never done this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.19,0:33:05.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看 我已经说了对不起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I said I was sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.31,0:33:07.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,求求你…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.44,0:33:10.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.90,0:33:12.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.40,0:33:14.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别动{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.86,0:33:16.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,停下来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it. Aah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.00,0:33:32.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？没事吧？- 感谢上帝{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you okay? Are you okay? - Thank God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.43,0:33:38.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,见鬼 你真的没事？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it. Are you sure you're okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.85,0:33:42.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有手机吗？拨911{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a cell phone? Call 911.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.95,0:34:01.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,让我们帮助你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us help you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.49,0:34:03.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.70,0:34:06.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你该安息了 托马斯 长眠吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to rest, Thomas, to be at peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.79,0:34:09.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,请让我给你做临终圣礼吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, let me give you last rites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.47,0:34:22.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,天上的圣灵啊 我以上帝的仆从的名义请求你们{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}O holy hosts above, I call upon thee as a servant of Christ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.06,0:34:27.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,以上帝之名祝福我们今天的仪式{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to sanctify our actions this day in fulfillment of the will of God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.03,0:34:35.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,雷诺神父？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father Reynolds?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.36,0:34:38.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,安息吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.71,0:34:51.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我请求天使长拉斐尔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I call upon the Archangel Raphael...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.13,0:34:55.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,天空的守护神 打开通道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}master of the air, to make open the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.92,0:35:00.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,让圣灵之火降临{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let the fire of the Holy Spirit now descend...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.18,0:35:04.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,让这个灵魂在另一个世界苏醒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that this being might be awakened to the world beyond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.10,0:36:31.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holy...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.60,0:37:16.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你那边怎么样？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was your day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.45,0:37:25.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是对的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.12,0:37:30.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是天使 是格雷戈瑞{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't an angel. It was Gregory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.31,0:37:54.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道 迪恩 我只是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, Dean. I just, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.31,0:38:02.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想要相信…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to believe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.82,0:38:05.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,真的非常想要相信{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so badly I'd...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.03,0:38:10.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但实在太困难了…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's so damn hard to do this...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.99,0:38:12.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们做的这些事…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.08,0:38:16.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么孤单{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All alone, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.29,0:38:20.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这世界上有那么多邪恶的东西 我都快窒息了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's so much evil out in the world, Dean, I feel like I could drown in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.54,0:38:25.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我一想起我的命运 一想起我以后会变成什么…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when I think about my destiny, when I think about how I could end up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.59,0:38:28.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别担心那个 好么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, don't worry about that, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.68,0:38:30.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有我罩着你呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm watching out for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.85,0:38:33.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是啊 我知道你会的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.06,0:38:38.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但你只是个人 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're just one person, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.73,0:38:45.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我还需要去思考一些其他的东西 你知道吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I needed to think there was something else watching too, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.86,0:38:50.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,比如… 神灵{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some higher power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.61,0:38:52.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,比如某种善良的力量{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some greater good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.99,0:38:56.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那样也许…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that maybe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.04,0:39:00.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.67,0:39:05.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许我能被拯救{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I could be saved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.26,0:39:17.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是 你知道 这种想法蒙蔽了我的判断力{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, uh, you know, that just clouded my judgment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.22,0:39:18.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是对的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.06,0:39:21.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说 我们只该相信我们了解的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta go with what we know, with what we can see...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.60,0:39:23.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,相信我们亲眼看到的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with what's right there in front of our own two eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.11,0:39:27.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有意思 你居然会这么说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, it's funny you say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.24,0:39:30.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.57,0:39:36.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,格雷戈瑞的鬼魂告诉你的没错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gregory's spirit gave you some pretty good information.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.41,0:39:39.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那个家伙不是个好东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy in the car was bad news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.41,0:39:41.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我差点就来不及了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I barely got there in time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.33,0:39:43.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,出什么事了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.79,0:39:45.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他死了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.34,0:39:51.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 难道你… - 不是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you...? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.14,0:39:57.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不过我告诉你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'll tell you one thing. If...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.18,0:40:01.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他死的方式如果不是亲眼所见{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way he died, if I hadn't seen it with my own two eyes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.73,0:40:03.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我一辈子都不会相信{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never would've believed it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.36,0:40:05.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.48,0:40:08.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what to call it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.49,0:40:12.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.45,0:40:17.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 你看到了什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, what did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.41,0:40:22.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.34,0:40:28.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是上帝的旨意{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God's will.{\r}
